/-!
# A119919

Table read by antidiagonals: number of rationals in [0, 1) having at most n preperiodic bits, then at most k periodic bits (read up antidiagonals).

The 56 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A119919

